cff-version: 1.2.0
title: NVD Enrichment Gap Tracker
message: >-
  If you use this dataset or code, please cite it using the
  metadata below.
type: dataset
authors:
  - given-names: Chukwuebuka
    family-names: Okorie
repository-code: "https://github.com/EbukaOkorie/nvd-enrichment-gap"
abstract: >-
  A dated snapshot series measuring how many CVE records lack the
  CPE product identifiers that vulnerability scanners require in
  order to detect them, derived from the U.S. National
  Vulnerability Database. Includes cohort analysis by publication
  month and a breakdown of coverage by assigning CVE Numbering
  Authority, used as a proxy for software ecosystem.
keywords:
  - vulnerability management
  - CVE
  - CPE
  - NVD
  - vulnerability scanning
  - security data
license: CC-BY-4.0
